      "en": "Cappadocia has no Ryanair or Wizz flights: take the night bus from Istanbul (about 11 h, to Göreme) or a domestic flight (Turkish, Pegasus or AJet) to Kayseri or Nevşehir plus a 1-hour transfer; with few days the flight is worth it. Book the balloon ahead and leave a spare day, as it is cancelled in wind. There is also a night bus from Cappadocia to Pamukkale."
